{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:15 2026-10-02 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:15 2026-10-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:15 2026-10-02 HKT</p><p>今(2日)早上11時25分，屯門赤鱲角隧道公路發生嚴重車禍。一部貨櫃車駛至龍富路迴旋處失控剷上路中分隔石壆，撞塌路牌，58歲男司機被困車內，消防接報到場，打爛乘客位車窗將他救出，57歲姓廖司機已陷昏迷，被送往屯門醫院搶救。警方正調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"涉事貨櫃車被拖走檢驗。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5878bfe2f340c4dcab6edb3e30b2d902/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_12_59_16_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防打破乘客位車窗救出傷者。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fa85a409e7e406f6edb324c662774767/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_12_59_22.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/232482731e374d8ab038d5bcc45ff35f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_12_59_21_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/23cf86e4e196cd62feaa0141ead548b1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_12_59_21.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉事貨櫃車被拖走檢驗。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/35b53bdeff6dc526f942301f558c735e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_12_59_20.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cf595433157c53d67e270b03d00e5e76/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_12_59_19.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"貨櫃車撞毀路牌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5834f9a043e299a40f6cc9920a893a2e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_12_59_15.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/459a6f42ed10fd5654779c8da132b46f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_12_59_14_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1be045207d5873e2953e313fff7d1f1d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-02_at_12_59_14.jpeg\"/><p>運輸署宣布，因交通意外，屯門赤鱲角隧道公路(往屯門方向)近龍富路迴旋處的部份行車線現已封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車。現時上址交通繁忙。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T05:58:55.512717+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":276,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}